    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMARY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617150/extras/32ab65d5f4c9ce4a6020ec68e3047e1f.poster.avif?t=1755624432\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617150/extras/32ab65d5f4c9ce4a6020ec68e3047e1f.webm?t=1755624432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617150/extras/32ab65d5f4c9ce4a6020ec68e3047e1f.mp4?t=1755624432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a delivery driver, owning a bicycle and a small house, working at a post office, delivering newspapers. Your goal is to either own the biggest van and be the one that delivers all the cargo of the Crestone State, or be the fastest food deliverer for Elroann Steakhouse, Leslie's Pizza, Pizza Queen or the Supermarket. Maybe you want to be an independent food deliverer and rule Sheber Eats and Bringy. Maybe you want to continue delivering newspapers, you choose your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617150/extras/f559dd61179f928e254bed45144d5a56.poster.avif?t=1755624432\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617150/extras/f559dd61179f928e254bed45144d5a56.webm?t=1755624432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617150/extras/f559dd61179f928e254bed45144d5a56.mp4?t=1755624432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world with dynamic weather and dynamic time of day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different pickup trucks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different scooters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different bicycles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different vans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 different AI character models. 11 of them are customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 different customer houses. All of them enterable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger, thirst, energy and mood to keep an eye on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable player houses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And more.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617150/extras/335f5a87106159d90a74f6aa9c5c5a26.poster.avif?t=1755624432\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617150/extras/335f5a87106159d90a74f6aa9c5c5a26.webm?t=1755624432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617150/extras/335f5a87106159d90a74f6aa9c5c5a26.mp4?t=1755624432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have reached your destination.</strong></p>",
